2026-10-25        [plan] DECISION API = Python library first; network service out of scope until v0.1 has proven itself in-process.
2026-10-25        [plan] DECISION Audience: ML researchers / systems engineers. Tokens, vectors and feature tensors handled by InputAdapter/OutputHead, outside the layer.
