2026-10-25        [plan] DECISION torch.compile: step fullgraph with zero recompiles; scan fullgraph per fixed-length chunk (not over variable T, which would unroll and recompile per length).
2026-10-25        [plan] DECISION State: frozen, tensor-only, pytree-registered dataclass; schema version is a class constant; semi-private torch APIs isolated in srwm/_compat.py.
